# Necrotic Ooze: "As long as Necrotic Ooze is on the battlefield, it has all activated abilities of all creature cards in all
# graveyards" (CR 613.1f). Dryad Arbor is a land creature card with the basic land type Forest, so as an object in the graveyard
# it has the intrinsic ability "{T}: Add {G}" though its text box prints none (CR 305.6), and the Ooze has it too. Turn 1: the
# Ooze is cast and Dryad Arbor is played; on turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Arbor. Turn 3: the Ooze taps for {G}.

